wikitext:
Used to put an upcoming match in the spotlight on the startpage.

This particular template displays <mark>2 individual players with a common flag</mark>.<br />
* For a version with player/teamname + an array of players, see {{Tl|MatchAbbr}}.<br />
* For a version with only playername/teamname, see {{Tl|Match}}.

== Example ==
The code:
<pre>{{match2on2|fi|fifi|fix|pl|insane|avenger|date=25 February 2022 20:00|event=Money for nothin and gibs for free|stream=Link}}</pre>

gives us:{{Col}}
===Game in spotlight===
{{match2on2|fi|fifi|fix|pl|insane|avenger|date=25 February 2022 20:00|event=Money for nothin and gibs for free|stream=Link}}


===Tournaments===
{{Upcoming}}
{{Event|Upcoming tournament 1|date=?|link=false|i=}}
{{Event|Upcoming tournament 2|date=?|link=false|i=}}
{{Endcal}}
{{Col-break}}
{{EndCol}}

